# Exercises the Recommendations endpoint against the compose stack (`make up`). It needs no token.
# A Product has something bought with it once an Order with it and another Product is paid, within
# the last 180 days: check out a Google Pixel 9 and a Sony WH-1000XM5 together as demo@ecomm.local on
# the Storefront first.

@recommendations = http://localhost:8098

### What Customers also bought with a Product, most bought together first, then filled up with its
### Category's best sellers, each with its `reason`: 4 unless `limit` says (1 to 12)
GET {{recommendations}}/products/PHN-PIXEL-9/also-bought

### A Product nothing was bought with: only its Category's best sellers, here the Sony WH-1000XM5 as
### POPULAR_IN_CATEGORY in Audio. A Product out of Stock is never one.
GET {{recommendations}}/products/AUD-JBL-FLIP-6/also-bought

### Up to 12 of them
GET {{recommendations}}/products/PHN-PIXEL-9/also-bought?limit=12

### A limit outside 1 to 12: 400
GET {{recommendations}}/products/PHN-PIXEL-9/also-bought?limit=13

### A SKU Recommendations has never heard of: no items
GET {{recommendations}}/products/NO-SUCH-SKU/also-bought
